  "text": "This solution, Cyclone Reinsurance Pool addresses natural catastrophe through public private partnerships in Australia between Australian Reinsurance Pool Corporation (ARPC), Australian Government Treasury, Australian Competition and Consumer Commission (ACCC), Bureau of Meteorology (BoM), and Private insurers. The program was implemented in 2022 and focuses on collaboration and regulation.",
